  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "You are given an array AAA of length NNN containing only the integers 1,2,1, 2, 1,2, and 333.\n\nIt is guaranteed that each of 1,2,1, 2, 1,2, and 333 appear at least once in AAA.\n\nConsider the following operation on AAA:\n\n\nFirst, choose two integers LLL and RRR such that 1≤L≤R≤N1 \\leq L \\leq R \\leq N1≤L≤R≤N.\nThen, for each index iii from LLL to RRR,\n\nIf Ai=1A_i = 1Ai​=1, replace it with 222.\nIf Ai=2A_i = 2Ai​=2, replace it with 333.\nIf Ai=3A_i = 3Ai​=3, replace it with 111.\n\n\nThat is, you will choose some non-empty subarray of AAA and add 111 to all its elements; with 333 turning into 111 instead.\n\nFor example, if A=[3,1,1,2,3,2]A = [3, 1, 1, 2, 3, 2]A=[3,1,1,2,3,2],\n\n\nIf you choose L=3,R=6L = 3, R = 6L=3,R=6, the resulting array will be [3,1,2,3,1,3][3, 1, 2, 3, 1, 3][3,1,2,3,1,3].\nIf you instead choose L=2,R=4L = 2, R = 4L=2,R=4, the resulting array will be [3,2,2,3,3,2][3, 2, 2, 3, 3, 2][3,2,2,3,3,2].\nIn how many ways can you perform this operation exactly once, such that the final array still contains at least one occurrence of each of 1,2,1, 2, 1,2, and 333?\n\n\nInput Format\n\nThe first line of input will contain a single integer TTT, denoting the number of test cases.\nEach test case consists of two lines of input.\n\nThe first line of each test case contains a single integer NNN, the length of the array AAA.\nThe second line contains NNN space-separated integers A1,A2,…,ANA_1, A_2, \\ldots, A_NA1​,A2​,…,AN​.\n\n\n\n\nOutput Format\nFor each test case, output on a new line the number of ways of performing the operation, such that the final array still contains all of 1,2,1, 2, 1,2, and 333.",
    "constraints": [
      "1≤T≤1051 \\leq T \\leq 10^51≤T≤105",
      "3≤N≤3⋅1053 \\leq N \\leq 3\\cdot 10^53≤N≤3⋅105",
      "1≤Ai≤31 \\leq A_i \\leq 31≤Ai​≤3",
      "AAA will contain at least one occurrence of each of 1,2,31, 2, 31,2,3.",
      "The sum of NNN across all tests won't exceed 3⋅1053\\cdot 10^53⋅105."
    ],
    "inputFormat": "",
    "outputFormat": "",
